<title>NEW ZEALAND: TENNIS-RESULT FROM NZ'S BELLSOUTH OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULT FROM NZ'S BELLSOUTH OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>AUCKLAND 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final of the BellSouth Open tennis tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Singles: Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Kenneth Carlsen (Denmark) 7-6 (7-0) 6-0.</p>
